// Mod Builder service 0.5: the real server.js pipeline, offline. The Claude CLI, javac, jar and
// javap are replaced by tiny fake programs, so this spends nothing and needs no JDK. It checks
// (the service passes the CLI only PATH/HOME/auth env, so the fake logs to $HOME/claude.log)
// the orchestration around the model: usage metering, the lean tool set, the deterministic
// auto-fixes (no model repair for a wrong import + a final main class), exact-repeat reuse and
// the `fresh` opt-out. Cyrus R1: texture specs (allowed -> validated + returned; invalid -> one asset
// repair; still failing -> dropped with a warning; not allowed -> section absent and the file removed;
// a change without texture rights keeps the base's specs byte for byte).
